---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import CtaBand from "../../components/CtaBand.astro";
import Comments from "../../components/Comments.astro";
import { whatsappLink } from "../../config";
---

<Layout
	title="Website Care in Kenya: DIY Checklist vs Managed (2026) | Orbit"
	description="What keeps a site alive: hosting, SSL, backups, updates. DIY checklist with free tools + what Orbit Care 7,499–13,999 covers."
>
	<Navbar />
	<main id="main">
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5">
			<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
				<div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/3 h-[400px] w-[600px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-electric/15 blur-[130px]"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-14 pt-20 md:pt-28">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric">Guides · Maintenance · 5 min</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
					Your site needs care. <span class="text-gradient">Do it yourself or delegate.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-400">Without care: slow loads, hacked forms, dead SSL, Google drops you. Here's the exact routine — free DIY or managed.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">DIY routine (30 min/month)</h2>
			<div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
				<div class="glow-border rounded-xl p-5"><p class="font-semibold text-white">Weekly</p><p class="mt-1 text-slate-400">Update CMS/plugins, scan with free Sucuri/Wordfence, check forms still send.</p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-xl p-5"><p class="font-semibold text-white">Monthly</p><p class="mt-1 text-slate-400">Run <a href="https://pagespeed.web.dev" class="text-electric hover:underline">PageSpeed</a> + Search Console, renew SSL auto-check, test backup restore, check 404s.</p></div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-xl p-5"><p class="font-semibold text-white">Always</p><p class="mt-1 text-slate-400">Daily off-site backup (Drive/Cloud), uptime ping via <a href="https://uptimerobot.com" class="text-electric hover:underline">UptimeRobot free</a>, WhatsApp alert on failure.</p></div>
			</div>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">When DIY fails</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Most hacked SME sites weren't targeted — they were just never updated. If you won't do the 30 min, delegate. That's the whole point of care plans.</p>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">What Orbit Care covers (and what it doesn't)</h2>
			<div class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-edge">
				<table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead class="bg-panel text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400"><tr><th class="px-4 py-2">Task</th><th class="px-4 py-2">DIY free</th><th class="px-4 py-2">Orbit Care</th></tr></thead>
				<tbody class="divide-y divide-edge text-slate-300"><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">Hosting + SSL + backups</td><td class="px-4 py-2">You buy</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-white">Included</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">Security patches</td><td class="px-4 py-2">You update</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-white">Weekly, we do</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">Speed tuning</td><td class="px-4 py-2">You test</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-white">Monthly re-check</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">Human support</td><td class="px-4 py-2">—</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-white">WhatsApp, Mon–Sat, minutes</td></tr></tbody></table>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 text-sm">
				<div class="rounded-xl border border-edge p-4"><p class="font-semibold text-white">Starter 7,499/mo</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">for 35,999 sites</p></div>
				<div class="rounded-xl border border-electric/30 p-4"><p class="font-semibold text-white">Business 10,999/mo</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">most popular</p></div>
				<div class="rounded-xl border border-edge p-4"><p class="font-semibold text-white">Master 13,999/mo</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">stores/bookings</p></div>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">Cancel anytime — site stays yours, we just stop watching it.</p>

			<div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-panel p-6">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Need us to watch it?</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">One message and it's handled. <a href={whatsappLink("Hi Orbit! I want Orbit Care — which tier fits my site?")} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-electric hover:underline">Get Care on WhatsApp →</a></p>
			</div>
		</article>

		<Comments slug="website-care-kenya" />
		<CtaBand title="Rather just have it handled?" text="From 7,499/mo — watched, updated and backed up." />
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
